        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>One-Way Viewer with Cover, Satin Chrome</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSecurity door viewer with inside cover to keep anyone from looking inside.  The glass lens allows for 160 degree viewing angle. Requires 1/2\" diameter hole in door and is adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\" thick doors. These security covered eye viewers are mostly use on hotel room door and apartment front doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-ULDV-90-Specifications.gif?v=1704354540\" width=\"355\" height=\"199\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo ULDV-90 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo ULDV90-DVC-626 One-Way Viewer with Inside Cover:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Lens Diameter: 3/5\" (.600\")</li>\r\n<li>Shaft Diameter: 15/32\" (.470\")</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>160 Degree Viewing</li>\r\n<li>Glass Lens</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 5R63 for Fire Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
